Test: Increment and Decrement Operators
--------------------------------------
Prefix increment:
  x = 5
  ++x = 6
  x = 6

Prefix decrement:
  y = 10
  --y = 9
  y = 9

Postfix increment:
  a = 3
  a++ = 3
  a = 4

Postfix decrement:
  b = 7
  b-- = 7
  b = 6

In expressions:
  c = 5 , d = 10
  c + ++d = 16
  c = 5 , d = 11

  e = 5 , f = 10
  e + f++ = 15
  e = 5 , f = 11

Multiple increments:
  g = 0
  ++g = 1
  ++g = 2
  g++ = 2
  g = 3

Array elements:
  arr[0] = 10
  ++arr[0] = 11
  arr[0] = 11
  arr[1]++ = 20
  arr[1] = 21

Precedence:
  h = 5 , i = 10
  -++h = -6
  h = 6
  -i++ = -10
  i = 11
